From 4e28514b1cd29d369c1b918cddcaf721328fc51c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CursorTD Dev <cursortd@example.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 06:58:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restructure wave spawning: split wave-manager.js into
 lifecycle vs timing logic

- New wave-spawn-builder.js: pure functions for computing spawn timelines
- Waves now define a 'period' (total spawn window) + 'activeSpawnPoints' instead of hand-tuned per-group spawnInterval
- Groups support packSize for pack-spawning (e.g. 9 scouts, packSize 3 -> 3 packs spread across period)
- All groups in a wave interleave (mix by time) instead of playing sequentially
- Rewrote all 10 waves in new format: period scales 3s->12s, activeSpawnPoints scales 1->3, scout groups pack in 3s
